WEBVTT

00:05:28.998 --> 00:05:30.838
She would be able to go to school

00:05:30.858 --> 00:05:34.998
and get closer to realizing her dream
of contributing to the health sector.

00:05:35.538 --> 00:05:37.898
We need to act now.

00:05:38.218 --> 00:05:40.798
We need to actively
and collectively ensure

00:05:40.818 --> 00:05:44.418
that going forward,
everyone has access to a free,

00:05:44.458 --> 00:05:46.498
fair and feminist internet.

00:05:46.838 --> 00:05:48.418
We cannot afford to look away

00:05:48.438 --> 00:05:51.538
simply because we are comfortable
and we have access.

00:05:51.558 --> 00:05:54.578
Because we need the contribution
of the two billion.

00:05:54.898 --> 00:05:58.178
We need them contributing
to the economies of our countries.

00:05:58.218 --> 00:06:00.158
We need their voices in politics.